==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/məˈnɪpjʊleɪt/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/m@"nIpjUleIt/}}
* {{audio|en-us-manipulate.ogg|Audio (US

===Etymology===
Back formation of {{term|manipulation}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|manipulat|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To [[move]], [[arrange]] or [[operate]] something using the [[hand]]s
# {{transitive}} To [[influence]], [[manage]], [[direct]], [[control]] or [[tamper]] with something
# {{transitive|medicine}} To [[handle]] and move a [[body]] part, either as an [[examination]] or for a [[therapeutic]] purpose

====Related terms====
* [[manipulandum]] {{pos n}}
* [[manipulation]] {{pos n}}

